# Project Structure and Conventions

Frontend lives in [`client`](mdc:client), backend in [`server`](mdc:server).

- App entry: [`client/src/main.tsx`](mdc:client/src/main.tsx) mounts `<App />` in `#root`.
- Routing: [`client/src/App.tsx`](mdc:client/src/App.tsx) with `react-router-dom`.
- Layout/UI: [`client/src/layouts`](mdc:client/src/layouts), [`client/src/components`](mdc:client/src/components).
- Content data: [`client/src/data/articles.json`](mdc:client/src/data/articles.json).
- Styling: Tailwind v4 via [`client/src/style.css`](mdc:client/src/style.css) with `@import "tailwindcss";`.
- Dev proxy: [`client/vite.config.ts`](mdc:client/vite.config.ts) proxies `/api` → `localhost:4000`.
- SEO assets: [`client/public/robots.txt`](mdc:client/public/robots.txt), [`client/public/sitemap.xml`](mdc:client/public/sitemap.xml).

Backend:
- Server: [`server/server.ts`](mdc:server/server.ts)
- Models: [`server/src/models`](mdc:server/src/models)
- Routes: [`server/src/routes`](mdc:server/src/routes) — `keywords`, `rank`, `history`

Conventions:
- Dark UI: background `#0B1220`, surfaces `#111827`, accent `#6366F1`.
- Articles live at `/blog/:slug`; use `<Helmet>` for title/description/canonical.
- Keep analytics endpoints lightweight; no heavy CMS.
